# Raspberry Pi firmware blobs allowed on a bcm2710 (Pi 3 / 3A+ / Zero 2 W) A/B card (#209 v4 D4).
# Source: raspberrypi/firmware release 1.20250915, raspi-firmware_1.20250915.orig.tar.xz
#   (sha256 545b5f8a624b98222c7b4ef4244ac219845993aba15e49d5440b21ccd722340e = GitHub release digest).
# Why pinned: 1.20250430 cannot boot from MBR partition 4 (raspberrypi/rpi-eeprom#705, fixed by
# raspberrypi/firmware 0ea2874060). That release is what OpenWrt bcm27xx-gpu-fw shipped, and the
# failure is a hang with no fallback (#209 E0f). All Pi 3 A/B hardware tests (#209 E0, E0d, E0g)
# ran on exactly these files. A date check would also accept branch builds without the fix.
# To bump: re-run #209 E0g on the new set, then replace every line below.
